":"paragraph","text":"前回から始めた大喜利。\nあの写真とお題は難しかったよね\nごめんね(>_<)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファンの方たちが提案してくれた\n「写真で一言」の方がやりやすいかな\nって思ったからそうするねー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『写真で一言』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2015/05/16/7510500/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回の写真で一言はこれ！\nコメント見るのがさらに楽しくなった"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『前回の写真で一言』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大喜利？にたくさんの方が参加\nしてくれました。\nありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その中からいいなと思ったのを\n紹介していきます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"No.47 ゆう❻ さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんはこの写メのアヒル口に\n気付いてくれるかなぁ（´-`）.｡oO"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"No.98 ヘルプマン木村 さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この煎餅ちょー硬いんだけどぉー。\nどうなってんのー？\nあーまじチョベリバー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"No.188 乃木坂大好きなshinjiさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は何故、自撮りをしながら、\nたたずんで煎餅を食べているんだ？\nよし、明日も頑張ろう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"No.319 りき⊿あしゅ神推し さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんな写真誰に需要があるのかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"No.329 まさるん@なんちゃって保育士 さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日からライザップ通うからこれは\n食べても大丈夫。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"No.371 しらたま さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"えっ、河童のお皿なん？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"No.380 サファイア茄子 さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なるほど、これが\"Japan\"の味か..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"No.474 シュウタ☆ さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この煎餅めっちゃみり愛(美味や)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"No.605 堀未央奈 さん(本人)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やばい、靴下穴あいてるやつ履いて来ちゃった"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"No.709 としき⊿あさがお棒人間 さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"誰がフリスビーをキャッチした犬や"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"No.805 うえぽん さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みりり委員会の会員費これだけで\n足りてると思ってる？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ウーっฅ(๑•̀ω•́๑)ฅー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回もまた受け付けてるよん(･∀･)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2015/05/16/7510500/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この制服ももう終わり..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今ある位置、今やらなければいけない\n課題を見つけクリアしていきたい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みり愛"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-2381":{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/04/111203_191722.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/04/111202_213747.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちわかつき(｀_´)ゞ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうも、北海道の吹雪で昨日まさかの飛行機が遅れ、お土産を大量に購入した、若月です。時間がたっぷり出来たので調子に乗りました。はい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北海道のイベントにいらして下さったみなさん(σ*´∀｀)!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございました♪"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/04/dimg0251.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"駅構内ということでみなさんとの距離がとても近く、沢山の声援をいただき若月は終始テンション高山でした(*´｀*)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/04/dimg0166.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、私たちのことを今回初めて知って下さった片や、名前だけ知っていて今回が初見!!という方が沢山いらっしゃってて、本当に嬉しい限りでしたΣ(ノд<)お１人だけでも私達乃木坂46の存在を知っていただけたら、今回のイベントは成功だと思っていたので、本当に沢山の方がいらしてくださり、大成功で終わることが出来ました!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大阪、名古屋に引き続き"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北海道も優しい方々ばかりで、街も良いところで最高でした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/04/dimg0256.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また大きくなった乃木坂46全員で北海道に行きたいですね♪(/ω＼*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さてさて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本日のブログ内容はですねぇ…"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"若月が逆に質問しちゃうぞ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/04/dimg0178.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/04/dimg0181.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"というわけで、皆さんに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問をしちゃいたいと思うわけですよ(*´｀*)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/04/dimg0182.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"答えてくれるカナ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/04/dimg0234.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"↑かなりんのを頂き(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さっそく！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ１:お住みの地域はどの辺ですか？もう12月ですが、寒いですか？(私の素朴な質問なので〜地方という答え方で全然大丈夫です^^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ２:地域オススメのスポットや食べ物ってありますか"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/04/dimg0171.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ３:足の裏がかゆい。でも、沢山の人がいる電車…しかもブーツ…さぁ、どうする"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/04/dimg0267.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/04/dimg0190.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ４:ワカツキ、みゅうみゅう、どっちが呼びやすい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/04/dimg0093.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"？(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ５:乃木坂46の存在は何がきっかけで知りましたか"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/04/dimg0179.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ６:若月に一言(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"という項目にしましたが、答えていただける範囲や質問だけで良いので是非教えてください"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/04/dimg0110.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/04/dimg0099.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんが私のことをもっと知りたいと言ってくださるように、私も同じようにもっともっとみなさんのことを知りたいしお話も聞きたいです♪(/ω＼*)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/04/dimg0205.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だって、私にとってみなさんは一番大切な人だから(///ω///)♪なんて…"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/04/dimg0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"照"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ででで、でわ ばかつきぃ〜ε＝(／Å<*)恥"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/04/dimg0095.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-37168":{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2017/03/02/6355030/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"のぎ天2のロケにて撮りました\nおっしゃれな飴ちゃん☺︎\n可愛い〜フォトジェニックな飴ちゃんです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんな大きなペロペロキャンディー\n誰が食べるの！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って今まで思ってたけど、\nこのロケの後に頂いた飴ちゃんを\n今日食べてみたら\n美味しかったしなんか楽しかった。笑\n歯磨きちゃんとしよう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"------------------------------------------------♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"#chihashot"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2017/03/02/6355030/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お洒落な照明。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"間接照明だから光が柔らかいし\n見た目もかっこいいし\nとても憧れる！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もし一人暮らししたら\nこれくらいお洒落なのにしてみたいな〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2017/03/02/6355030/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ピンクの薔薇をフィルター加工して\n紫色にしてみました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"作り物のような不思議な薔薇に\n吸い込まれそうになる..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お花って良いよね。\n今まではただ綺麗だなとしか思わなかったけど\n最近その魅力に引き込まれている気がする！\n大人になったのかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブルゾンちえみさんもしゃべくりで\nお花の魅力に大人になってから気付き始めたって言ってたもんね(＾ｰ^)\n(メイクしようかな...)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"------------------------------------------------♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♬ ChihaMusic"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「Girl」秦基博さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"子供を持つ親御さんは\nこの曲に共感できると思う。\nそして子供からしたら\nこう思ってもらえてたら良いなとも思う。\nそれくらい美しくて素敵な曲。\n\"どんな不安の中でも\n心配しないで 必ず見つけ出すよ\"\nどんな事があっても家族だけは\n最後まで必ず味方でいてくれる。\n不安な事、辛い事があっても\n家族の存在があれば救われるよね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2017/03/02/6355030/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は衣替えしたり\nお部屋の整理整頓したり\nのんびり過ごしました〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お家から一歩も出なくていい日も好き。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"斎藤ちはる"}],"source":"archive"}}